<title>UK: Deutsche Bau-Und Boden sets 300 mln mark 7-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau-Und Boden sets 300 mln mark 7-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU-UND BODEN BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    14.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    +1/16	PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.79     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
